== Trivia ==
* Bomber Boy is a reference to the 1983 video-game ''[[wikipedia:Bomberman|Bomberman]]''. ''Bomber Boy'' is, specifically, the original name of a Game Boy game known as ''[[wikipedia:Atomic Punk|Atomic Punk]]'' in the United States and ''Dynablaster'' in Europe and Oceania.

